    "**ADAM ID: **[sm\\_us7000ss57](https://api.adam.geospatial.wfp.org/api/collections/adam.adam_eq_events/items?uid=sm_us7000ss57) Magnitude 5.5 earthquake at 49.891 depth occurred on Jun 11 2026 59km S of Sarangani. The epicentre of the earthquake was located at latitude 4.8778 longitude 125.4356. It impacted 2 people within 50km. WFP’s Automated Disaster Analysis and Mapping (ADAM) system is an operational system for collecting, analysing and mapping geospatial and socio-economic information following sudden onset humanitarian emergencies."
